---
/**
 * DependencyLabBoard.astro - Lab 2: Dependency Time Machine & Supply Chain Lab
 * 1. SemVer range resolution (~16.2.0 vs 16.2.3 vs 16.2.4)
 * 2. helm dependency update vs helm dependency build
 * 3. Exact Chart.lock structure and digest guarantees
 * 4. Thin Repository (.gitignore archives) vs Vendored Air-gap (commit archives)
 * 5. Reproducing the out-of-sync error
 */
---
<div class="helm-dep-board" data-helm-dep-board>
  <div class="dep-toolbar">
    <div class="dep-timeline-control">
      <span class="dep-lbl">TIME MACHINE:</span>
      <button type="button" class="dep-time-btn is-active" data-time="day1">Day 1: Initial Release (v16.2.3 latest)</button>
      <button type="button" class="dep-time-btn" data-time="day14">Day 14: Upstream Bump (v16.2.4 published)</button>
      <button type="button" class="dep-time-btn is-err" data-time="tamper">Drift: Chart.yaml modified without updating Lock</button>
    </div>
    <div class="dep-repo-control">
      <span class="dep-lbl">GIT STRATEGY:</span>
      <button type="button" class="dep-strat-btn is-active" data-strat="thin">Thin Repo (.gitignore charts/*.tgz)</button>
      <button type="button" class="dep-strat-btn" data-strat="vendored">Vendored Air-Gap (Commit .tgz)</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="dep-grid">
    <!-- Box 1: Chart.yaml -->
    <div class="dep-col">
      <div class="dep-box-header">1. Chart.yaml (Intent)</div>
      <pre><code>dependencies:
  - name: postgresql
    version: <b class="hl" data-dep-range>"~16.2.0"</b>
    repository: "https://charts.example.com"
  - name: redis
    version: "20.1.4"
    alias: cache</code></pre>
      <div class="dep-note">
        <code>~16.2.0</code> accepts any patch version ≥ 16.2.0 and &lt; 16.3.0.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Box 2: CLI Action -->
    <div class="dep-col action-col">
      <div class="dep-box-header">2. Resolution CLI</div>
      <div class="cmd-choice">
        <button type="button" class="dep-action-btn is-active" data-action="build">
          <strong>helm dependency build</strong>
          <small>CI Pipeline (Strictly respects lock)</small>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="dep-action-btn" data-action="update">
          <strong>helm dependency update</strong>
          <small>Developer (Resolves latest ranges)</small>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="action-console">
        <span class="console-lbl">EXECUTION LOG:</span>
        <pre><code data-dep-log>$ helm dependency build ./payment-api
Rebuilding dependencies from Chart.lock...
Fetching postgresql 16.2.3 (matching lockfile)
Fetching redis 20.1.4 (matching lockfile)
Dependencies built successfully.</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Box 3: Chart.lock -->
    <div class="dep-col">
      <div class="dep-box-header">3. Chart.lock (Reproducibility)</div>
      <pre><code data-dep-lock>dependencies:
- name: postgresql
  repository: https://charts.example.com
  version: 16.2.3
- name: redis
  repository: oci://registry.example.com
  version: 20.1.4
digest: sha256:4b91f0a1c8d4...
generated: "2026-10-17T00:00:00Z"</code></pre>
      <div class="lock-verdict" data-dep-verdict>
        <strong>REPRODUCIBLE IN CI:</strong> Guaranteed identical build across any runner.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Git Boundary Banner -->
  <div class="dep-git-boundary" data-dep-git-banner>
    <div class="git-badge">GIT COMMIT BOUNDARY: THIN REPOSITORY</div>
    <div class="git-desc">
      <span>Tracked in Git:</span> <code>Chart.yaml</code>, <code>Chart.lock</code>, <code>values.yaml</code>, <code>templates/</code>.
      <span class="sep">|</span>
      <span>Ignored (.gitignore):</span> <code>charts/*.tgz</code> (downloaded on-the-fly in CI via <code>helm dependency build</code>).
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.helm-dep-board {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
  background: var(--surface-bg, #161a22);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle, #30363d);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 1rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
}
.dep-toolbar {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;
  padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.dep-timeline-control, .dep-repo-control {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.45rem;
}
.dep-lbl {
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: #8b949e;
}
.dep-time-btn, .dep-strat-btn {
  background: #21262d;
  border: 1px solid #30363d;
  color: #c9d1d9;
  padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s ease;
}
.dep-time-btn:hover, .dep-strat-btn:hover { background: #30363d; }
.dep-time-btn.is-active, .dep-strat-btn.is-active {
  background: #1f6feb;
  color: #fff;
  border-color: #58a6ff;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.dep-time-btn.is-err.is-active {
  background: #da3633;
  border-color: #f85149;
  color: #fff;
}

.dep-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
}
@media (max-width: 960px) {
  .dep-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
.dep-col {
  background: #0d1117;
  border: 1px solid #30363d;
  border-radius: 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.dep-box-header {
  font-size: 0.725rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: #8b949e;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  background: #161b22;
  padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;
}
.dep-col pre {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0.6rem;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: #c9d1d9;
  flex: 1;
}
.hl { color: #58a6ff; font-weight: bold; }
.dep-note {
  background: #161b22;
  border-top: 1px solid #21262d;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
  font-size: 0.725rem;
  color: #8b949e;
}

/* Action col */
.cmd-choice {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  padding: 0.6rem;
}
.dep-action-btn {
  background: #161b22;
  border: 1px solid #30363d;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: all 0.15s ease;
}
.dep-action-btn:hover { background: #21262d; }
.dep-action-btn.is-active {
  border-color: #58a6ff;
  background: #1c2d42;
}
.dep-action-btn strong { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #f0f6fc; }
.dep-action-btn small { font-size: 0.68rem; color: #8b949e; }
.action-console {
  background: #000;
  border-top: 1px solid #21262d;
  padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
  font-family: monospace;
}
.console-lbl { font-size: 0.625rem; color: #8b949e; font-weight: bold; }
.action-console pre { padding: 0.35rem 0; color: #7ee787; font-size: 0.725rem; }

.lock-verdict {
  background: #161b22;
  border-top: 1px solid #21262d;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
  font-size: 0.725rem;
  color: #7ee787;
}

.dep-git-boundary {
  background: #161b22;
  border: 1px dashed #30363d;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
}
.git-badge {
  font-size: 0.675rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: #f0f6fc;
  background: #30363d;
  padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 3px;
}
.git-desc { color: #8b949e; }
.git-desc code { color: #79c0ff; }
.git-desc .sep { margin: 0 0.35rem; color: #30363d; }
</style>
